          {
            "title": "Customize a collection",
            "id": 152139,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le API pubbliche spesso restituiscono raccolte molto grandi, mentre un'app potrebbe aver bisogno solo degli elementi che corrispondono a una singola scelta.</p><p>I parametri di query permettono a una richiesta di descrivere questa scelta. Imparerai ad aggiungerli agli URL e alle richieste Python.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 2, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;JavaScript&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Start a query string",
            "id": 152140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un punto interrogativo avvia una stringa di query dopo l'endpoint. Poi viene il nome del parametro.</p><p>Questa API usa <code>id</code> per identificare i corsi. Aggiungi il punto interrogativo e il nome del parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>id</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add a parameter value",
            "id": 152141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un segno di uguale collega il nome del parametro al suo valore.</p><p>Aggiungi il valore <code>1</code> per richiedere il corso con l'id <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un segno di uguale collega il nome del parametro al suo valore.</p><p>Crea la stringa di query per richiedere il corso con <code>id</code> uguale a <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>id</code>, <code>=</code> e infine <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Use different value types",
            "id": 152142,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori dei parametri possono identificare elementi con numeri, come <code>1</code>, o corrispondere a testo, come il nome di un corso.</p><p>Completa il valore stringa che richiede il corso <code>Python</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"parameter_values.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"string_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?name=Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori dei parametri possono identificare elementi con numeri, come <code>1</code>, o corrispondere a testo, come il nome di un corso.</p><p>Questa API usa <code>id</code> per gli ID numerici e <code>name</code> per i nomi dei corsi.</p><p>Richiedi l'ID <code>1</code> in <code>number_url</code> e il corso <code>Python</code> in <code>string_url</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"parameter_values.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"string_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?name=Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"course\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>id</code>, seguito da <code>name</code> e infine <code>Python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose another post",
            "id": 152143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiedi all'API il corso con ID <code>3</code> digitando il nome del parametro di query <code>id</code>, poi un segno di uguale <code>=</code> e infine il numero <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"comment_feed.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>id=3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
