            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale URL richiede dati dall'API per un utente con ID <code>4</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/courses?userId=4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Questa API filtra gli utenti con il parametro <code>userId</code>.</p><p>Quale URL richiede dati dall'API per un utente con ID <code>4</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/courses?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?id=4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code>.</p></body></html>",
