            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Recupera l'utente con ID <code>3</code> usando il parametro di query <code>userId</code> dell'API.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"todo_request.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/users?userId=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"postId\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>userId</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>3</code> e infine <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
