        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "A More Focused Request",
            "id": 152218,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sappiamo già che possiamo usare un parametro di query come filtro. Vediamo come possiamo combinare più filtri per ottenere un risultato ancora migliore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the First Parameter",
            "id": 152219,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di iniziare a combinare più stringhe di query, costruiamo prima un URL con una sola.</p><p>Crea una stringa di query per filtrare i corsi per lingua.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>language</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Make Room for Another",
            "id": 152220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una e commerciale <code>&amp;</code> separa un parametro di query dal successivo.</p><p>Aggiungi <code>&amp;</code> dopo il parametro della lingua per fare spazio a un altro parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Second Parameter",
            "id": 152221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il secondo parametro segue la e commerciale senza un altro punto interrogativo.</p><p>Aggiungi <code>level=beginner</code> per richiedere corsi per principianti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>level</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il secondo parametro segue la e commerciale senza un altro punto interrogativo.</p><p>Mantieni il filtro della lingua e aggiungi il filtro <code>level</code> con il valore <code>beginner</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"language\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"python\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&amp;</code>, seguito da <code>level</code>, <code>=</code> e infine <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Second Parameter - Copy",
            "id": 152240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se usiamo <code>&amp;</code> per combinare più parametri di query, verranno usati tutti nella query, purché l'API li supporti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se usiamo <code>&amp;</code> per combinare più parametri di query, verranno usati tutti nella query, purché l'API li supporti.</p><p>Richiedi corsi Python per principianti, mantenendo prima <code>language</code> e poi <code>level</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"advanced\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"javascript\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>python</code>, <code>&amp;</code> e infine <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Send the Combined Request",
            "id": 152222,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'URL completato ora contiene entrambi i filtri del corso.</p><p>Passa <code>url</code> a <code>requests.get()</code> per inviare la richiesta combinata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>requests</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'URL completato ora contiene entrambi i filtri del corso.</p><p>Recupera i corsi che corrispondono a entrambi i filtri, quindi analizza la risposta come JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>requests</code>, seguito da <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>, <code>response</code> e infine <code>json</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
